CloudBSD parallel packaging of the amdgpu DRM 6.6 kernel module.

Depends on graphics/cloudbsd-drm-66-core-kmod. Can be installed alongside
other CloudBSD vendor modules (i915, radeon, nvidia-drm) for the same
DRM version line.

Enable with: kld_list="amdgpu" in /etc/rc.conf
(or use sysutils/cloudbsd-gpu-autoload).
